{"rowNumber":1707,"id":"com_14.ks#1707","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"兄貴ヅラのすかした顔で紫苑の名を呼ばなくて本当によかった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1710,"id":"com_14.ks#1710","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくは、激しく、勃起していた。\nもうそれは、完全に、くっきりと。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1714,"id":"com_14.ks#1714","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"行き場を失ったぼくのちんこがパンツで反り返り明確なちん筋を描いている。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1717,"id":"com_14.ks#1717","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"こんなものを紫苑に見られたら、永久に幻滅されるに違いない。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1720,"id":"com_14.ks#1720","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"勃起我慢選手権は紫苑選手の圧勝に終わった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1732,"id":"com_14.ks#1732","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"その後ぼくは、気もそぞろ、挙動もそぞろに\n紫苑の言いなりとなってその他の点検などの手伝いに同行した。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1736,"id":"com_14.ks#1736","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そして、彼女が弁当を食べると言い出したのを口実に\n逃げるようにそそくさと退散する――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1747,"id":"com_14.ks#1747","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「じゃぁ、ぼくは先に帰るね」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1753,"id":"com_14.ks#1753","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1761,"id":"com_14.ks#1761","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"その時、紫苑は何も言わずただ小さく手を振ってくれた、ような気がした。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""}
